00:06:43.889 --> 00:06:49.340
Man, we speak a very nice, unique, language.

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:51.169
That's sexy, ain't it?

00:06:51.169 --> 00:06:52.169
It's sexy.

00:06:52.169 --> 00:06:55.780
When you become an entrepreneur, you're part
of a certain community that we speak a complete

00:06:55.780 --> 00:06:56.780
