00:06:56.780 --> 00:06:57.949
#13: Contribution.

00:06:57.949 --> 00:06:59.979
You are contributing to society.

00:06:59.979 --> 00:07:01.690
You are creating jobs.

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:03.509
You are helping people advance in life.

00:07:03.509 --> 00:07:08.290
You are helping design better products, better
